{"item_uid": "指考99-civics-001", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 99, "year_ce": 2010, "subject_key": "civics", "subject_zh": "公民與社會", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 10, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "現代社會的公共部門常與民間組織合作來提供公共服務，下列何者屬於此種公私協力關係？", "options": {"A": "公益團體所屬的游泳池委外經營", "B": "公立高中體育館由民營公司承建", "C": "政府補助私立學校辦理親職教育", "D": "政府允許民間資金投資國營事業"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 9.0, "B": 38.0, "C": 19.0, "D": 30.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 7.0, "B": 43.0, "C": 23.0, "D": 25.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 11.0, "B": 31.0, "C": 18.0, "D": 33.0}, "omit_rate": 4.0, "p_value": 19.0, "p_high": 23.0, "p_low": 18.0, "discrimination": 5.0, "p_quintiles": [25.0, 19.0, 17.0, 17.0, 18.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考99-civics-002", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 99, "year_ce": 2010, "subject_key": "civics", "subject_zh": "公民與社會", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 11, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "大華不滿小明拒絕出借上課筆記，一時氣憤，在個人部落格「私日記」中，用網路流行用語「腦\n殘丁丁」來指稱小明。小明得知後上網點閱，發覺該篇文章已有多人點閱，自覺名譽受損，乃向\n法院提起告訴。依據上文訊息，下列敘述何者正確？", "options": {"A": "負面網路流行語亦屬言論自由範疇，大華無刑責", "B": "即使大華公開發文道歉，仍不能阻卻行為的違法", "C": "如果大華被檢方依法起訴，即須賠償小明的損害", "D": "部落格為個人專屬空間，屬於隱私權保護的範圍"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "B", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 2.0, "B": 39.0, "C": 55.0, "D": 1.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 1.0, "B": 58.0, "C": 39.0, "D": 1.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 3.0, "B": 24.0, "C": 67.0, "D": 2.0}, "omit_rate": 3.0, "p_value": 39.0, "p_high": 58.0, "p_low": 24.0, "discrimination": 34.0, "p_quintiles": [65.0, 44.0, 35.0, 28.0, 21.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考99-civics-003", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 99, "year_ce": 2010, "subject_key": "civics", "subject_zh": "公民與社會", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 12, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "由於傳播科技發達，個人資料常遭不當引用，使隱私權受到侵害。下列關於個人資料引用與隱私\n權保障的敘述，何者正確？", "options": {"A": "個人資料的保護亦屬憲法人格權的保障範圍", "B": "媒體報導揭露個人資料只要不提及姓名即可", "C": "在網路張貼與朋友聚會的合照涉及人身自由", "D": "個人的犯罪前科不受隱私權保障以維護公益\n- 2 -\n第 3 頁 99年指考\n共 7 頁 公民與社會"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "A", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 75.0, "B": 2.0, "C": 4.0, "D": 16.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 76.0, "B": 1.0, "C": 2.0, "D": 18.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 73.0, "B": 3.0, "C": 6.0, "D": 14.0}, "omit_rate": 3.0, "p_value": 75.0, "p_high": 76.0, "p_low": 73.0, "discrimination": 3.0, "p_quintiles": [77.0, 76.0, 76.0, 75.0, 71.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考99-civics-004", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 99, "year_ce": 2010, "subject_key": "civics", "subject_zh": "公民與社會", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 13, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "我國現行法律規定，公家機關與民間企業皆應雇用一定比例的身心障礙員工，否則須繳納差額補\n助費，納入身心障礙福利經費。上述規定所彰顯的意義，下列何者最為正確？", "options": {"A": "此為降低失業率的優惠措施", "B": "此為去除歧視待遇的平權措施", "C": "此為改善弱勢者地位的特權規定", "D": "此為落實正當法律程序的手續規定"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "B", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 0.0, "B": 51.0, "C": 43.0, "D": 4.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 0.0, "B": 57.0, "C": 39.0, "D": 3.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 1.0, "B": 44.0, "C": 47.0, "D": 5.0}, "omit_rate": 1.0, "p_value": 51.0, "p_high": 57.0, "p_low": 44.0, "discrimination": 13.0, "p_quintiles": [59.0, 54.0, 50.0, 47.0, 43.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考99-civics-005", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 99, "year_ce": 2010, "subject_key": "civics", "subject_zh": "公民與社會", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 14, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "某原住民族部落的族人，根據部落議會決議，將被風吹倒的櫸木殘枝載回部落使用。此舉被認定\n在國有林地竊取國有財產而遭地方法院判刑。但高等法院依據學術研究調查報告，認為該族確實\n有將山中資源視為部落財產的傳統生活模式，且被告無竊盜犯意又未破壞生態，因此全部改判無\n罪。如上所述，本案有罪或無罪的權衡，主要涉及哪兩者的衝突？", "options": {"A": "國有財產管理與學術研究報告", "B": "原住民族習慣與國家法律規範", "C": "原住民族習慣與學術研究報告", "D": "國家法律規範與生態環境保護"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "B", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 11.0, "B": 81.0, "C": 1.0, "D": 7.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 4.0, "B": 95.0, "C": 0.0, "D": 1.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 18.0, "B": 63.0, "C": 3.0, "D": 14.0}, "omit_rate": 1.0, "p_value": 81.0, "p_high": 95.0, "p_low": 63.0, "discrimination": 32.0, "p_quintiles": [96.0, 91.0, 85.0, 75.0, 56.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考99-civics-006", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 99, "year_ce": 2010, "subject_key": "civics", "subject_zh": "公民與社會", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 15, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "政府為興建高速公路而欲徵收雅欣所有的一塊農地。依據我國現行法律的規定，關於雅欣的權\n益，下列敘述何者正確？", "options": {"A": "若不滿徵收價格可依據民法請求賠償", "B": "若不滿徵收價格依法可拒絕政府徵收", "C": "因徵收所受損失依法可請求國家賠償", "D": "因徵收所受損失依法可獲得國家補償"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "D", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 2.0, "B": 2.0, "C": 25.0, "D": 68.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 1.0, "B": 1.0, "C": 12.0, "D": 85.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 3.0, "B": 4.0, "C": 37.0, "D": 50.0}, "omit_rate": 3.0, "p_value": 68.0, "p_high": 85.0, "p_low": 50.0, "discrimination": 35.0, "p_quintiles": [89.0, 78.0, 70.0, 60.0, 44.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考99-civics-007", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 99, "year_ce": 2010, "subject_key": "civics", "subject_zh": "公民與社會", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 16, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "為落實人權保障，我國法律逐漸放寬釋憲聲請的條件。依據現行法律的規定，關於釋憲的聲請，\n下列敘述何者正確？", "options": {"A": "人民因行政機關行政處分導致其權利受損時，即可聲請釋憲", "B": "某立法委員就行使職權適用憲法發生疑義時，即可聲請釋憲", "C": "某法官審理案件發現適用法律有違憲疑義時，即可聲請釋憲", "D": "某政黨接受人民請願發現法律有違憲疑義時，即可聲請釋憲"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 9.0, "B": 6.0, "C": 69.0, "D": 6.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 3.0, "B": 3.0, "C": 88.0, "D": 4.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 17.0, "B": 9.0, "C": 47.0, "D": 9.0}, "omit_rate": 9.0, "p_value": 69.0, "p_high": 88.0, "p_low": 47.0, "discrimination": 41.0, "p_quintiles": [91.0, 82.0, 73.0, 61.0, 39.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考99-civics-008", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 99, "year_ce": 2010, "subject_key": "civics", "subject_zh": "公民與社會", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 17, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "大法官的解釋曾指出，各級學校依相關規定對學生所為之處分，若足以改變其學生身分及其受教\n機會時，學生可依法提起訴願及行政訴訟。依據此項解釋要旨，下列哪種情況產生時，學生得提\n起訴願及行政訴訟？", "options": {"A": "在校刊撰文批評校長而遭學校體罰", "B": "考試時連續作弊而遭學校退學處分", "C": "連續在學校廁所抽菸而遭記過處分", "D": "因裸奔使校譽受損而遭到留校察看"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "B", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 23.0, "B": 74.0, "C": 0.0, "D": 2.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 7.0, "B": 92.0, "C": 0.0, "D": 1.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 42.0, "B": 51.0, "C": 1.0, "D": 4.0}, "omit_rate": 1.0, "p_value": 74.0, "p_high": 92.0, "p_low": 51.0, "discrimination": 41.0, "p_quintiles": [94.0, 87.0, 78.0, 67.0, 42.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考99-civics-009", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 99, "year_ce": 2010, "subject_key": "civics", "subject_zh": "公民與社會", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 18, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "冰島政府過去大幅放寬國內金融市場管制，銀行迅速擴張，經濟發展令人稱羨。但之後的金融危\n機，使該國主要銀行爆發擠兌並陷入短期資金困境，造成貨幣貶值，經濟面臨嚴重衰退，總理哈\n爾德（G. Haarde）不得不於2008年底宣布該國瀕臨破產危機。根據以上資訊推論，冰島當時可能\n出現的經濟狀況或政策為何？\n甲、國內生產毛額GDP呈現大幅下降 乙、冰島央行降低利率來增加貨幣量\n丙、冰島不得不向世界銀行融資借錢 丁、外國遊客對冰島的觀光需求銳減", "options": {"A": "甲丙", "B": "乙丁", "C": "甲乙", "D": "丙丁"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 59.0, "B": 3.0, "C": 26.0, "D": 5.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 56.0, "B": 2.0, "C": 34.0, "D": 4.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 58.0, "B": 3.0, "C": 21.0, "D": 6.0}, "omit_rate": 7.0, "p_value": 26.0, "p_high": 34.0, "p_low": 21.0, "discrimination": 13.0, "p_quintiles": [38.0, 27.0, 24.0, 22.0, 21.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考99-civics-010", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 99, "year_ce": 2010, "subject_key": "civics", "subject_zh": "公民與社會", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 19, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "鯨魚被國際環保組織列為保育動物，但仍有國家不顧國際禁令捕殺鯨魚，使瀕臨絕種的鯨魚更為\n稀少；相對地，鱸魚是市場可以買到的養殖魚類，沒有絕種的危機。下列何者為影響這兩種魚類\n是否絕種的主要原因？", "options": {"A": "鱸魚的經濟價值相對較低", "B": "鯨魚的需求大於鱸魚需求", "C": "公海中的鯨魚屬於公共財", "D": "兩種魚獲的外部效果不同"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "D", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 38.0, "B": 4.0, "C": 19.0, "D": 35.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 33.0, "B": 2.0, "C": 28.0, "D": 34.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 42.0, "B": 6.0, "C": 12.0, "D": 35.0}, "omit_rate": 4.0, "p_value": 35.0, "p_high": 34.0, "p_low": 35.0, "discrimination": -1.0, "p_quintiles": [34.0, 35.0, 36.0, 37.0, 34.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考99-civics-011", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 99, "year_ce": 2010, "subject_key": "civics", "subject_zh": "公民與社會", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 20, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "下列四項經濟變數所具之流量或存量的觀念，哪項與其他三項不同？\n甲、年底貨幣供給總量 乙、夏季飲料消費數量 丙、七月汽車進口數量 丁、今年大學入學人數", "options": {"A": "甲", "B": "乙", "C": "丙", "D": "丁"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "A", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 33.0, "B": 11.0, "C": 7.0, "D": 37.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 48.0, "B": 9.0, "C": 6.0, "D": 29.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 21.0, "B": 12.0, "C": 8.0, "D": 45.0}, "omit_rate": 13.0, "p_value": 33.0, "p_high": 48.0, "p_low": 21.0, "discrimination": 27.0, "p_quintiles": [53.0, 37.0, 30.0, 25.0, 19.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考99-civics-012", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 99, "year_ce": 2010, "subject_key": "civics", "subject_zh": "公民與社會", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 21, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "假設某日新台幣兌美元匯率為32：1，某位投資人以32萬新台幣換得1萬美元並轉為外幣存款，美\n元存款年利率為4％，同期台幣存款年利率為2％。一年後新台幣升值為31元兌1美元，該投資人\n將外幣存款領出換為新台幣。在不考慮其他情況下，如果當時他以新台幣存款，則台幣存款收益\n比起美金存款收益，結果為下列何者？", "options": {"A": "多新台幣6400元", "B": "多新台幣4000元", "C": "少新台幣6400元", "D": "少新台幣4000元\n- 3 -\n99年 指 考 第 4 頁\n公民與社會 共 7 頁"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "B", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 5.0, "B": 42.0, "C": 9.0, "D": 18.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 2.0, "B": 64.0, "C": 5.0, "D": 19.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 9.0, "B": 22.0, "C": 13.0, "D": 16.0}, "omit_rate": 26.0, "p_value": 42.0, "p_high": 64.0, "p_low": 22.0, "discrimination": 42.0, "p_quintiles": [69.0, 54.0, 39.0, 29.0, 19.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考99-civics-013", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 99, "year_ce": 2010, "subject_key": "civics", "subject_zh": "公民與社會", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 22, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "在只考慮所得多寡的情況下，依據我國所得稅制度，關於「綜合所得稅」的概念，下列何者正確？", "options": {"A": "採綜合所得愈高繳納稅額愈多的租稅設計", "B": "有所得就要納稅合乎租稅效率的基本原則", "C": "個人所得稅額可在購物時將稅額轉嫁商家", "D": "職業相同的人應繳納的所得稅額也會相同"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "A", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 66.0, "B": 22.0, "C": 3.0, "D": 1.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 87.0, "B": 9.0, "C": 1.0, "D": 0.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 42.0, "B": 36.0, "C": 5.0, "D": 2.0}, "omit_rate": 9.0, "p_value": 66.0, "p_high": 87.0, "p_low": 42.0, "discrimination": 45.0, "p_quintiles": [91.0, 80.0, 69.0, 56.0, 35.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考99-civics-014", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 99, "year_ce": 2010, "subject_key": "civics", "subject_zh": "公民與社會", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 23, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "目前我國失業率偏高，社會大眾普遍關切如何降低失業率。按照「失業率」的定義，下列社會現\n象與失業率之間的關連，何者正確？", "options": {"A": "少子化會增加失業率，因為勞動力減少", "B": "少子化會減少失業率，因為勞動力減少", "C": "一人同時兼職兩份工作會降低失業率，因為可以增加GDP", "D": "大學入學率提高會減少失業率，因青少年失業率高於平均值"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "D", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 15.0, "B": 49.0, "C": 3.0, "D": 22.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 13.0, "B": 48.0, "C": 1.0, "D": 31.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 18.0, "B": 46.0, "C": 6.0, "D": 15.0}, "omit_rate": 11.0, "p_value": 22.0, "p_high": 31.0, "p_low": 15.0, "discrimination": 16.0, "p_quintiles": [35.0, 24.0, 20.0, 17.0, 14.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考99-civics-015", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 99, "year_ce": 2010, "subject_key": "civics", "subject_zh": "公民與社會", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 24, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "某國政府為提振汽車買氣，提出購買新車補助的方案。該方案對於汽車需求的影響，下列敘述何\n者正確？", "options": {"A": "若人們喜歡新車，補助後會使汽車需求增加", "B": "消費者有個人主觀考量，汽車需求不會改變", "C": "鋼鐵等原料成本因此上升，汽車需求會減少", "D": "因與新車具替代性，中古車的需求量會下降"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "A", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 57.0, "B": 6.0, "C": 3.0, "D": 30.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 66.0, "B": 2.0, "C": 1.0, "D": 29.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 46.0, "B": 11.0, "C": 5.0, "D": 31.0}, "omit_rate": 4.0, "p_value": 57.0, "p_high": 66.0, "p_low": 46.0, "discrimination": 20.0, "p_quintiles": [68.0, 62.0, 59.0, 54.0, 41.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考99-civics-016", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 99, "year_ce": 2010, "subject_key": "civics", "subject_zh": "公民與社會", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 25, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "依據上文訊息判斷，關於該國的社會現象，下列哪些敘述比較可能？\n甲、家庭的成員減少且照顧功能減弱 乙、隔代教養和單親的家庭日漸增多\n丙、婦女面臨就業與生養子女的兩難 丁、社會價值變遷使不婚的人數增加\n戊、婚姻移入的女性移民逐年成長中", "options": {"A": "甲丙", "B": "甲丁", "C": "乙丁", "D": "丙戊"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": "25-26", "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "A", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 19.0, "B": 12.0, "C": 4.0, "D": 64.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 28.0, "B": 8.0, "C": 1.0, "D": 63.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 11.0, "B": 16.0, "C": 8.0, "D": 62.0}, "omit_rate": 2.0, "p_value": 19.0, "p_high": 28.0, "p_low": 11.0, "discrimination": 17.0, "p_quintiles": [31.0, 21.0, 18.0, 14.0, 10.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考99-civics-017", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 99, "year_ce": 2010, "subject_key": "civics", "subject_zh": "公民與社會", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 26, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "該國某些政治人物對於限制生育補助對象的主張，是下列何種論述的反映？", "options": {"A": "文化相對論", "B": "種族中心論", "C": "文明衝突論", "D": "族群階層論"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": "25-26", "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "B", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 4.0, "B": 82.0, "C": 3.0, "D": 9.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 2.0, "B": 91.0, "C": 1.0, "D": 6.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 7.0, "B": 69.0, "C": 6.0, "D": 13.0}, "omit_rate": 2.0, "p_value": 82.0, "p_high": 91.0, "p_low": 69.0, "discrimination": 22.0, "p_quintiles": [92.0, 89.0, 85.0, 80.0, 63.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考99-civics-018", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 99, "year_ce": 2010, "subject_key": "civics", "subject_zh": "公民與社會", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 27, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "依據圖三訊息判斷，該社會勞動市場與人力資源的性別特色，下列何者最可能？", "options": {"A": "新世代女性就業意願明顯較低", "B": "新世代男性教育程度高於女性", "C": "父親世代的男女就業較為平等", "D": "新世代就業具有性別隔離現象"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": "27-28", "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "D", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 3.0, "B": 11.0, "C": 41.0, "D": 38.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 3.0, "B": 12.0, "C": 27.0, "D": 55.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 4.0, "B": 10.0, "C": 55.0, "D": 22.0}, "omit_rate": 6.0, "p_value": 38.0, "p_high": 55.0, "p_low": 22.0, "discrimination": 33.0, "p_quintiles": [60.0, 46.0, 37.0, 28.0, 18.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考99-civics-019", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 99, "year_ce": 2010, "subject_key": "civics", "subject_zh": "公民與社會", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 28, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "依據圖三訊息判斷該國的社會變遷，可能的重要特色有哪些？\n甲、社會流動的幅度高 乙、貧富差距持續擴大 丙、資訊科技迅速發達\n丁、經濟結構快速轉型 戊、失業率高且薪資低", "options": {"A": "甲乙", "B": "乙丙", "C": "甲丁", "D": "丁戊\n- 4 -\n第 5 頁 99年指考\n共 7 頁 公民與社會"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": "27-28", "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 5.0, "B": 5.0, "C": 82.0, "D": 2.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 2.0, "B": 1.0, "C": 95.0, "D": 0.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 9.0, "B": 9.0, "C": 65.0, "D": 5.0}, "omit_rate": 5.0, "p_value": 82.0, "p_high": 95.0, "p_low": 65.0, "discrimination": 30.0, "p_quintiles": [96.0, 92.0, 87.0, 78.0, 59.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考99-civics-020", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 99, "year_ce": 2010, "subject_key": "civics", "subject_zh": "公民與社會", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 29, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "若表三的統計資料是兩國社會團體總數的變化情形，且兩國歷年的人口總數相當，關於兩國社會\n特徵的比較，下列敘述何者最有可能？", "options": {"A": "甲國社會運動的發展比較緩慢", "B": "甲國的社會資源分配比較平均", "C": "乙國非營利組織的多元性較高", "D": "乙國公民的社會參與意願較高"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": "29-30", "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "D", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 13.0, "B": 3.0, "C": 13.0, "D": 66.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 12.0, "B": 2.0, "C": 10.0, "D": 74.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 13.0, "B": 5.0, "C": 16.0, "D": 57.0}, "omit_rate": 4.0, "p_value": 66.0, "p_high": 74.0, "p_low": 57.0, "discrimination": 17.0, "p_quintiles": [76.0, 70.0, 68.0, 64.0, 53.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考99-civics-021", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 99, "year_ce": 2010, "subject_key": "civics", "subject_zh": "公民與社會", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 30, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "若表三的統計資料是兩國政府補助社會團體總金額的變化情形（單位：億元），且兩國歷年的政\n府預算總額和社會團體數目相當，關於兩國志願結社發展的比較，下列敘述何者最可能？", "options": {"A": "甲國社會團體較容易獲得民間的捐款", "B": "甲國較易產生志願結社的外部性問題", "C": "乙國社會團體的自主性較易受到質疑", "D": "乙國的社會團體較能彌補政府的不足"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": "29-30", "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 7.0, "B": 8.0, "C": 38.0, "D": 33.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 4.0, "B": 5.0, "C": 64.0, "D": 22.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 9.0, "B": 12.0, "C": 16.0, "D": 40.0}, "omit_rate": 14.0, "p_value": 38.0, "p_high": 64.0, "p_low": 16.0, "discrimination": 48.0, "p_quintiles": [71.0, 50.0, 35.0, 23.0, 12.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考99-civics-022", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 99, "year_ce": 2010, "subject_key": "civics", "subject_zh": "公民與社會", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 31, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "依據上述資訊，如果這個國家的選舉係採單一選區相對多數決制，關於該國的選舉結果和未來政\n黨政治的發展，下列哪項推論最可能？", "options": {"A": "總得票數最多的政黨是乙黨", "B": "政黨必須聯盟籌組聯合內閣", "C": "丙黨是法案通過的關鍵少數", "D": "甲乙兩黨未來將會輪流執政"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": "31-32", "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 30.0, "B": 14.0, "C": 23.0, "D": 21.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 26.0, "B": 17.0, "C": 36.0, "D": 15.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 31.0, "B": 11.0, "C": 12.0, "D": 27.0}, "omit_rate": 13.0, "p_value": 23.0, "p_high": 36.0, "p_low": 12.0, "discrimination": 24.0, "p_quintiles": [42.0, 27.0, 20.0, 15.0, 10.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
